        "Content": "<ul><li> Beautifully presented four-bedroom home</li><li> Prime position overlooking communal green</li><li> Highly sought-after Grosvenor Park development</li><li> Excellent turnkey condition throughout</li><li> Accommodation arranged over three levels</li><li> Four generous double bedrooms</li><li> Two bathrooms</li><li> Flexible home office / walk-in wardrobe space</li><li> Comfortable living accommodation</li><li> Approx. 35 ft. rear garden</li><li> Designated parking space</li><li> Additional on-street parking</li><li> Attractive leafy outlook to the front</li><li> Quiet setting just off Leinster Road</li><li> Rathmines Village within a five-minute walk</li><li> Rathgar, Ranelagh, Portobello and Harold's Cross within easy reach</li><li> Excellent parks and green spaces nearby</li><li> Superb Dublin 6 location</ul>"
